                "text": "I enjoyed meeting with Jerry Shaffer and Mike Constantine, two dedicated advocates working to make a meaningful difference in the lives of fellow Veterans facing mental health challenges. Jerry is the founder of the Red Star Organization, which is committed to one vital mission: preventing suicide within the Veteran community. I\u2019m grateful for their passion, leadership, and tireless efforts to support those who have served our nation.",
