                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "A special thank you to the local dentists who volunteered their time for my 10th Annual Stars, Stripes, and Smiles event, providing free dental care to Veterans experiencing dental pain. Oral health is a critical part of overall wellness, and I\u2019m proud that legislation I championed was recently signed into law, establishing a pilot program to expand Veterans\u2019 access to dental care. In the meantime, these dedicated volunteers are helping meet the urgent needs of our community.",
