                "text": "November is Alzheimer\u2019s Disease Awareness Month, a time to honor those affected by this devastating disease and to recognize the caregivers, families, and medical professionals who support them every day.\nAlzheimer\u2019s touches millions of Americans, and raising awareness is critical to advancing research, improving care, and providing resources to those in need. Let\u2019s continue working together to support patients, empower caregivers, and push for treatments that can change lives. #AlzheimersAwarenessMonth #EndAlzheimers",
