                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "I\u2019m urging action on my bill to require Medicare coverage for medical devices approved under the FDA\u2019s Breakthrough Devices Program. Despite FDA clearance, Medicare can take more than six years to determine coverage-delaying access to life-saving innovations for millions of seniors.  My legislation ensures timely access to breakthrough treatments and supports the more than 600 medical device companies in Florida working to bring new technologies to patients. I\u2019ve heard directly from many of them about how outdated Medicare delays hold back innovation. It\u2019s time to fix this.",
